    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d44">

                <pb facs="0226" n="54" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg54"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/3355a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Sweden</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Morris</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-02-19T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">February 19, 1917, 4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>130. Department understands that Swedish Government has invited the neutrals to
                    participate in a conference in Stockholm through their diplomatic
                    representatives at that capital to discuss <pb facs="0227" n="55" xml:id="pg55"
                    /> matters of interest to neutrals arising after the war. Please report to the
                    Department upon this matter and keep Department advised of future
                    developments.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
